{
  "title": "删除方法",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n  <h1>删除方法</h1>\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <ol>\n    <li class=\"Numbered\">在导航窗格中，选择<strong>Administration&gt;Methods</strong>。将出现以下菜单：</li>\n  </ol>\n  <p class=\"Figure_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/methodmenu.jpg\"></p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  \n  <ol start=\"2\">\n    <li class=\"Numbered\">点击<strong>Search Methods</strong>。搜索网格将出现。</li>\n    <li class=\"Numbered\">点击<img src=\"/aras-images/searchbutton.jpg\">查看方法列表。</li>\n  </ol>\n  <p class=\"Figure_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/methodlist.jpg\"></p>\n  \n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  \n  <ol start=\"4\">\n    <li class=\"Numbered\">右键点击要删除的方法。将出现以下上下文菜单：</li>\n  </ol>\n  <p class=\"Figure_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/contextmenu2.jpg\"></p>\n  \n  <ol start=\"5\">\n    <li class=\"Numbered\">选择<strong>Purge This Version</strong>以删除方法的最新版本。选择<strong>Delete All Versions</strong>以删除方法的所有版本。将出现类似以下的对话框：</li>\n  </ol>\n  <p><img src=\"/aras-images/purgemethod.jpg\">\n  </p>\n  <ol start=\"6\">\n    <li class=\"Numbered\">点击<strong>OK</strong>。</li>\n    <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n    <!--?rh-list_start class=\"rl-p-Note\" an=\"1\" level=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\n                                 list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  </ol>\n  <p class=\"Note_indented\">注意：如果在确认弹窗之后出现错误消息，表示该条目未被删除。错误消息中会出现对应ItemType（物料类型）的属性名称，格式为[itemtype_name property_name}，该属性必须从ItemType（物料类型）中删除。</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  \n  \n\n</div></body></html>",
  "sourceFile": "Deleting_a_Method.htm"
}